#: modules/acfml-sync-fix/module.php
msgid "Disable Sync Repeater for ACFML"
msgstr ""

#: modules/acfml-sync-fix/module.php
msgid "Disables the ACFML repeater sync checkbox and its stored option — prevents accidental field sync across languages."
msgstr ""

#: modules/wpml-independent-duplicates/module.php
msgid "Independent WPML duplicates"
msgstr ""

#: modules/wpml-independent-duplicates/module.php
msgid "Turns WPML \"Duplicate\" into a one-off copy: the duplicate is unlinked from the original right away, so it opens in the WordPress editor and is no longer overwritten when the original is saved."
msgstr ""

#: modules/wpml-media-sync/module.php
msgid "WPML media in every language"
msgstr ""

#: modules/wpml-media-sync/module.php
msgid "Every media file uploaded in one language shows up in the media library of all the others. Locks WPML media translation on \"Configure manually\" with duplication of new media on, and fills in existing media that is missing from a language, once a day and whenever a language is added. With media folders (Media Manager or FileBird), the copies go into the same folder as the original."
msgstr ""

#: modules/acfml-copy-once/module.php
msgid "ACFML: Copy once everywhere"
msgstr ""

#: modules/acfml-copy-once/module.php
msgid "Puts every ACF field group in Expert mode with every field set to \"Copy once\", and realigns the WPML custom field settings when a field group is saved: saving the original no longer overwrites the translations, and pages can still be duplicated in bulk."
msgstr ""

#: modules/disable-flamingo-addressbook/module.php
msgid "Disable Flamingo Addressbook"
msgstr ""

#: modules/disable-flamingo-addressbook/module.php
msgid "Prevents Flamingo from saving any data to its address book — form submissions are still stored in the inbound messages log."
msgstr ""

#: modules/disable-comments/module.php
msgid "Disable Comments"
msgstr ""

#: modules/disable-comments/module.php
msgid "Disables the comment system site-wide — closes comments on all posts and pages (new and existing), hides existing ones, and removes the Comments menu and Discussion settings from the admin."
msgstr ""

#: modules/disable-comments/module.php
msgid "Comments are closed."
msgstr ""

#: modules/svg-flatten/module.php
msgid "Flatten SVG on Upload"
msgstr ""

#: modules/svg-flatten/module.php
msgid "Rewrites uploaded SVGs so they can be inlined side by side — the style block is dropped, its declarations move onto the elements as fill/stroke attributes, and ids are namespaced per file."
msgstr ""

